WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.520
I rode shotgun in a lead humvee

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.740
And I looked for bombs.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.400
Stop the truck

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.700
You don't see the bomb unless they want you to.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.320
What you got?

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.840
Yo I don't see nothing man

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.960
You don't see it, he feels it.

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.720
I was a good soldier

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.140
I had purpose, and I loved it

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.500
You kick some ass over there?

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:28.720
Yeah, yeah man

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.580
We wanted it to be perfect

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:36.000
I'm home with my favorite girls, it's perfect baby.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.480
-Am I getting laid or what?

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.200
Oh yeah, you're getting laid.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.160
How long you been up?

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.680
It's already 4 PM in Baghdad

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.220
One chocolate chip smiley face pancake for ya

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.420
She doesn't like chocolate

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.340
Ok guess I missed that.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:02.180
Therapist:Two army commendations, an army achievement medal, impressive.

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:09.540
Wife:You never told me you were a hero. Don't spare me the details, I can take anything but quiet.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:16.320
You are my hammer out there don't let these young guys see you fold.

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:18.880
I don't belong here.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:20.480
He did his job, now do yours.

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:27.700
-You alright? -No I'm not alright.

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:32.960
Can't name him after me. He's too perfect.

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:38.720
Is there a specific incident that troubles you?

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:56.340
I now this don't look like much of a life. But every morning I get up I'm grateful. I'm alive because of you.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.100
Woman: Thank you for looking after my son.

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:09.840
I'm not a hero, we're brothers we look after each other.

